# This repository is the public distribution point, not the source tree.
# Binaries belong to Releases (assets), never to git -- a 62 MB .exe per
# version would make the clone every user's `git clone` has to do grow
# without bound, and GitHub warns past 50 MB / rejects past 100 MB.
*.exe
*.rar
*.zip
*.7z

# Nothing from the private source tree should ever land here.
*.py
__pycache__/
build_logs/
